{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Famous Artists", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The  Components of a Superstar", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > Charlie Chaplin", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In order to make questions and negative statements in the Simple Past and the Present Perfect, we use the auxiliary verbs for every tense.<br />  For the Simple Past, we use the auxiliary verb DID. We do not conjugate the principal verb when we use the auxiliary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Example</span>: <br><span class=\"italic\"><ul>  \t<li>Did you audition for the film?</li> \t<li>I didn't see the auditions. </li> \t<li>We didn't see the film. Did you see it? I didn't listen to the Oscar Awards winner. Did you listen to the speech?</li> </ul>   \t\t\t</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For the Present Perfect, we use the auxiliary verb HAVE or HAS, depending on the person. The principal verb will always be in the Past Participle form (regular or irregular).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Example</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul>  \t<li>Have you ever auditioned for a film? </li> \t<li>I haven't seen any auditions. </li> \t<li>I've never acted on a stage. Have you ever participated in a play? I haven't got involved in any project. Have you started any movie project?</li>  </ul>   \t\t\t</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ambitious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "desiring success", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Superstars must be ambitious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about superstars.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "larger-than-life", "type": "name"}, {"content": "impressive; memorable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Most superstars are larger-than-life.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "goal-oriented", "type": "name"}, {"content": "focused on a goal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is important to be goal-oriented to be successful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tycoon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person of great wealth, influence or power", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Business tycoons are superstars, too.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "politician", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who holds a political office", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Politicians are seen as superstars, too.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pursue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go after a goal or person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must bravely pursue your dreams to become a superstar.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "failure ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a lack of success", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Success is stumbling from failure to failure.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "enthusiasm ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a lively interest in something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Having enthusiasm is an important  part of achieving success.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le06ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you met a superstar.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue between you and them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them to describe themselves and how they became a superstar.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue between me and a superstar.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask the superstar questions about how they became famous.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le06ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Have you ever been to a concert? Who do you think is a superstar? Lady Gaga? Madonna? What are the components of a superstar? I've asked many people what they think the qualities of a superstar are."}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "Here are some words they have used to describe them:\nambitious, hard-working, larger-than-life, pioneering, tough, smart, energetic, powerful, fun, goal-oriented and creative. Can you think of any other words?"}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "32500", "id": 3, "text": "I have mainly focused on creative superstars, but there are other kinds of superstars, too. What about sports stars? Or business tycoons? Politicians? Scientists? Have you ever considered that they, too, could be superstars? I think you have to work extremely hard, learn things fast and bravely pursue your dreams to become a superstar."}, {"image": "engenn6le06ob09re2img03.jpg", "time": "58000", "id": 4, "text": "As the famous politician Winston Churchill once said, \u201cSuccess is stumbling from failure to failure with no loss of enthusiasm.\u201d\nWrite to me and tell me who your top ten superstars are and why. Let's see who is at the top of the list!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le06ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le06ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "engenn6le06ob09re6aud01", "type": "audio"}], "id": 3}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn6le06ob09re5aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le06ob09re5img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 4}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can describe people I admire.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can describe the quality of an object or a person. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about how something happens or how someone behaves. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Are there any superstars in your country?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Who are they and why a